# Line endings: store LF in the repository and check out LF on every OS.
# Without this, Windows' core.autocrlf=true rewrites the working tree to CRLF on
# the next checkout, producing "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and noisy
# diffs. Node, PowerShell and Git all handle LF fine on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
